fsarchiver is a tool which can save the contents of a complete filesystem to a compressed archiver file.

fsarchiver have a advantage of new filesystem's (ext4)

The extension for fsarchiver is .fsa

fsarchiver savefs backup.fsa block(/dev/sda1)

For multiple
------------

fsarchiver savefs backup.fs /dev/sda1 /dev/sda2

To restore a parition from a  backup archive


fsarchiver restfs backup.fsa id=0,dest=/dev/sda1

id=0 denote the first parition

fsarchiver restfs backup.fsa id=0,dest=/dev/sda1  id=1,dest=/dev/sda2


